        "limits": {
          "cpu": "750m"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "expected_effect": "Raise the CPU limit of the 'api' container to 750m, which should alleviate throttling and allow the container to meet its CPU demands without hitting the limit.",
  "rationale": "The container is currently throttled at 64% of its 500m CPU limit, with usage near the limit (0.495/0.5). The rollout changed the container image, and readiness probes are failing due to timeouts, indicating CPU contention. Raising the limit to 750m (1.5x current) should clear the throttling without affecting memory or other resources.",
